; Two across, not four. The original's corner-action wording ("BREATHE AND
; RELAX", "WIPE IT WITH WATER") is the characterful mistranslation the dossier
; calls out, and it does not fit four to a 1080px row. It used to be trimmed to
; one word with the full phrase in a tooltip — unreachable on a touchscreen,
; since a phone has no hover.
